er-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;原則年２回、その他必要に応じて開催&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
